{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1000_p", "source_sha256": "24a2ebebc6646cb6b35d1ab5507311ae49736b0d50b4c098abf4baec36fb9086", "ja": "（映画『悪役？令嬢』の撮影は順調だ。真が演じる\nトルマン公爵が活躍するのは、もう少し先か……）", "zh": "（电影《反派？千金》的拍摄进展顺利。真饰演的托尔曼公爵大显身手，还要再等一阵子吗……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1001_006mak", "source_sha256": "4586930bdb06ce0eafdb7dac45e2daa7f722e964de4ddc221b85302aaebb7e2a", "ja": "1、2、3、4……よし！\nこれくらいで十分かな。", "zh": "1、2、3、4……好！\n这样应该就够了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2092fe57a9e8c939b2a92a0e4ff50200873657c7bb3cbae6fcbe1b18a6a105d2", "ja": "お疲れ様、真。ストレッチしてるのか？\n公爵の出番まで、まだ少しあるのに。", "zh": "辛苦了，真。你在做拉伸吗？\n离公爵登场还有一会儿呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "bb6fca6227b285a159414638c4c9e085ff7eebdbfd8eaebee9cca44c0853f40c", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまです！　そう\nなんですけど、次って乗馬のシーンじゃないですか。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！是的，不过接下来不是骑马的场景吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "b43f8e0d1eba50569d1df19d16da3a67c2b4166f476eafba0e51e8ef1c12cea9", "ja": "あれって、何気に全身運動なんですよね。\nだからケガしないよう、入念に準備しとこうと思って。", "zh": "那个其实挺费全身力气的呢。\n所以我想着充分做好准备，免得受伤。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1005_p", "source_sha256": "891c8539804e301eed8cf7e6e5c6af332f20191d2321bf2462683b0c36a46d6d", "ja": "流石だな。乗馬を教えてくれた講師の先生も、\n真は飲み込みが早いって褒めてたよ。", "zh": "真不愧是你啊。教你骑马的那位老师也夸你，说真学得很快。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "ad5891b91456b498f287c89cc6df22da3d27421019e5c2fc5b57ffaa60e71081", "ja": "本当ですか！　えへへ、うれしいなぁ～。\n今回乗せてもらう馬とも、相性がよかったみたいで。", "zh": "真的吗！嘿嘿，好开心啊～  \n看来我和这次骑的马也很合得来呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "b64a9389ee311e303e8c19ef7521c1b5887dbd4aaf7ae580d40a8eddc3953a64", "ja": "常歩から始まって、最後は人馬一体で全力疾走！\n馬上で感じる風、気持ちよかったなぁ～。", "zh": "从慢步开始，到最后人马一体全力飞驰！\n在马背上迎面感受到的风，真让人身心舒畅啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1008_p", "source_sha256": "65796d421e45d9c231f61b7a45032bc47df8c2225afe2ea92b61d62e9f04db18", "ja": "馬に慣れるための最初の講習で、\n全力疾走までしてたもんな……。", "zh": "为了适应马匹而上的第一堂课，\n居然就一直练到了全力疾驰啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8d659ae06ba7d337fc84d014a363f08f2224f308a3395b9e1f6e2fd1c69ab98b", "ja": "あれからも何度か練習があったけど、\nその様子だと、問題ないみたいだな。", "zh": "在那之后也有过几次练习，\n看你这个状态，应该没问题了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1010_006mak", "source_sha256": "d2d3cd8dbc193cdb7dc3ec709a2c750c973abf4057a9bde0663f25546d4b9d7f", "ja": "はい！　出演させてもらう以上、いい作品に\nしたいっていう気持ちは、いつもありますけど。", "zh": "是！既然有机会出演，我一直都希望能把作品\n做得更好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "9ed902d43e64bc67d8df458a358b19e2c566cecbc08c9fb6176ccb9919139032", "ja": "ここまでのみんなの演技を見ていたら、\n「ボクも負けてられないぞ！」って思って……。", "zh": "看到大家演到这里，我就觉得“我也不能输给大家！”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1012_p", "source_sha256": "38aa87d45a996b4dee5aa477742842949e3607972f84bdea74b44e3b1c03a166", "ja": "そうか。\nみんなの熱意が、真の原動力ってわけだな！", "zh": "这样啊。\n大家的热情，就是你真正的动力啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "ce61a2fff2a9d719f766a32c09f496b87b2c60d7282cf48e47adafbc57644526", "ja": "はい！　それに、カッコ悪いじゃないですか。\n馬も乗りこなせない公爵なんて。", "zh": "是的！而且，那样不是很逊吗？\n连马都驾驭不了的公爵什么的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "f783958311cb6147f286be95371095049357f832a20edb2515c636725c9f0082", "ja": "公爵って、普段は何を考えているかわかり辛いから。\n決めるところで、バシッと決めないと！", "zh": "因为公爵平时很难让人看出他在想什么。\n所以该果断的时候，就要干脆利落地做出决定！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1015_006mak", "source_sha256": "7f73e16ec8779f4d9350f8f0f0d94b07119bb37250e19b5943fbb7d6ec7df523", "ja": "そういうギャップに、みんな\nキュンキュンすると思うんです！", "zh": "我觉得大家都会为这种反差怦然心动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1016_p", "source_sha256": "27469e59116ab967dad6a50a972ebd1b84b41df3b0075b93760c54424132bd13", "ja": "流石、乙女の心理をよくわかってるな！　映画を観た人\nみんな、公爵を好きになっちゃうんじゃないか？", "zh": "不愧是你，真懂少女的心理啊！看过电影的人，应该都会喜欢上公爵吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1017_006mak", "source_sha256": "ea2742e4a8f02d715491dcce7c331ea0dcc703a856201c8e0eef6802c91f2bfb", "ja": "もちろん、そのつもりですよ！\n少なくとも、伊織には絶対負けられませんから！", "zh": "当然，我就是这么打算的！\n至少，我绝对不能输给伊织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_006mak0353_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_006mak0353_1018_006mak", "source_sha256": "9e1837b2e738ad49a4cd12c72683d4f04f64566e265420f331409729b1abead4", "ja": "あっ、もちろん{$P$}のことも、\nキュンキュンさせますからね！　期待しててください♪", "zh": "啊，当然也会让{$P$}心动不已！请期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
